WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Crouching heavy punch punishes Ryu’s recovered OD Shoryuken.

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.550
Ken stops Quick Dash and links standing medium punch.

3
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.050
The running overhead kick continues the punish.

4
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:08.750
Ken cancels the overhead into Level 3.

5
00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:09.750
Ryu lands after the Level 3 punish.
